<H3><CENTER><FONT COLOR="#ffff00"><A HREF="mailto:sedicivalvole@yahoo.com">Baber Sheikh</A></FONT></CENTER></H3>

        Baber has a 1991 J registered black 5 door Tipo. He's been the owner
        since October 1994 and brought the car when it had 16,000 miles on
        it. This is his 6th Tipo 16V. Baber buys and sells Tipo 16V's and he
        currently (August 1999) has 3 but is selling 2 of them. His car
        doe not have ABS or Recaros, but it has got heated seats and tinted
        windows.
        His car has been
        extensively modified by Barry Waterhouse Engineering and is seriously
        fast.
        <P>
        The complete impressive specification is as follows:
        <P>
        <B>Engine:</B> Re-bored 84.6mm Mahle Pistons. Re-ground and polished
        crank with Vandervell shells. Lightened and balanced flywheel.
        BWE re-mapped eprom. 3 angle valve seats and thema turbo
        exhaust valves.
        <P>

        <B>Suspension:</B> Standard Tipo dampers on front and Fiat Coupe on rear with
        Eibach progressive springs all round. OMP front strut brace.
        <P>
        <B>Exhaust:</B> Remus full system. Stainless steel cat replacement
        pipe with resonator.
        <P>
        <B>Induction:</B> Freeflow JR panel filter.

<P>
